<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB to raise 20 bln yen in Euro MTN issue.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB to raise 20 bln yen in Euro MTN issue.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Wheat Board (AWB) said on Friday it would raise 20 billion yen from the issue of June 1999 Euro medium term notes.</p>
<p>The AWB said the notes were redeemable in Australian currency and it would convert the notes into U.S. dollars.</p>
</text>
